  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"77\"><mn>77</mn>\n</math>. It&rsquo;s given that the function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x squared plus x plus 71\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>71</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis squared plus 2 plus 71\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>71</mn></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 4 plus 2 plus 71\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>71</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 77\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>77</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"77\"><mn>77</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
